  "title": "Adopting instant payments doesn’t have to disrupt everything",
  "summary": "The world is moving to instant everything. In the payments arena, this means that the old world of multi-day or multi-intraday payment clearing is disappearing forever. This is great news for the consumer, but a major challenge for the bank, requiring expensive accommodation as part of an already crowded change agenda.",
